{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging levels on single-player or multiplayer (2-4 players). Players can complete the game from level 1. Also, players can freely choose all unlocked levels from the start. Gameplay is easy as you can think of a casual game just completing on each level, but do not forget this is Another Level game that is different from usual levels. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and different gameplay for some levels. There will be interesting gameplay that players may have never experienced before. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer playing with friend :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging levels with a friend (2-4 players). Those who knock out first will be watching other players until they finish the level. The game will restart level once all players have lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging and unique level :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels might be hard or easy with unique and good seeing graphics. There are some strange platforms or level that can make players lose from the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618910?t=1770554174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618910/822261de77924a1fe426a1157b2068a3cd04f52d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770554174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618910/70e1b1b614b867e240f93702fd7998efbd5fa793/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770554174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618910/70e1b1b614b867e240f93702fd7998efbd5fa793/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770554174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"